# ===================================================================
# 📁 Directory Defaults
# ===================================================================
# Nothing is tracked unless it's named.

*


# ===================================================================
# ✅ What actually ships
# ===================================================================
# Adding a file to the repo means adding it here first.
#
# Note for later: `*` excludes directories too, and git won't look
# inside an excluded one. A future `docs/` needs `!docs/` before
# `!docs/**` will do anything.

!.gitignore
!.gitattributes
!LICENSE
!README.md
!OverlyDetailed.user.js
!demo.html
